      "side": 1,
      "message": "Question: why exactly need to put the FPU if it is in use?\n\nAlso in what cases fpstate-\u003ein_use may be already true when kvm_vcpu_reset() is called?",
      "revId": "cb6c7508841c8a33ef9006d8a21449c0272c98fc",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0bacd708_818d20c1",
        "filename": "arch/x86/kvm/pkvm/x86.c",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 2919,
      "author": {
